    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enumerate states based on provided <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1ParticleStates" kindref="compound">ParticleStates</ref> objects.</para>
<para>The produced states are filtered using the provided <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1SubsetFilterTable" kindref="compound">SubsetFilterTable</ref> objects. Branch and bound is used to try to make this process more efficient. To do that the <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1SubsetFilterTable_1abaa42cb0bed9f3c8fcfa4c3ac3e0162b" kindref="member">SubsetFilterTable::get_strength()</ref> method is used to order the particles from most restricted to least restricted. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
